fdlibm (via V8)
========================================================================

jsfdlibm.go ports the fdlibm log routine that V8 (Node.js) executes for
Math.log, from deps/v8/src/base/ieee754.cc, to keep scores bit-exact
with lunr.js. fdlibm: Copyright (C) 1993 by Sun Microsystems, Inc. V8's
ieee754.cc is distributed under V8's BSD-style license.
